                <pb facs="0426" n="322" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg322"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr.
                            White.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-12-30"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 30,
                        1889</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Authorizes Mr. White to confer with Lord Salisbury concerning the reëstablishment
                    of diplomatic relations between Great Britain and Venezuela upon the basis
                    suggested by the Venezuelan minister, of temporary restoration of <hi
                        rendition="#italic">status quo</hi>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
